From 7679364d954dd069b7dcfdc9a5a2f799d5f75fbe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Laze ." <laze.@MacBook-Pro-50.local>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 13:31:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Expose continuous immersion for opt-in Aurora underwater post

Keep native fluid simulation and old shader ABI. Let water.3 compose water fog, remove the binary water overlay, and blend camera FOV over a continuous fluid volume.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
